  "teaching_question": "When an annual report discloses a material plant-acquisition approval, what must be kept unresolved before using the issuer as a comparative carrier?",
  "mechanism_hypothesis": "A disclosed consolidation-scope break is a perimeter-continuity question, not evidence that the operating business exited or that a later comparative result is directional learning.",
